{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153500/extras/f7914a17171940ec969d944f7056104b.webp?t=1770146785\" width=800 height=24 /></span><br><br><strong>OBA DOBA is a Roguelike RTS/Tower Defense game</strong>. Inspired by the likes of They Are Billions, Starcraft, and Vampire Survivors, the experience boils down to frantic macro and micro of your Oba Dobas, structures, and upgrade choices in real time. Gableebin.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153500/extras/e2e58b1fc2f3250df241fd4a7b867ced.avif?t=1770146785\" width=800 height=94 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Embark on randomly generated campaigns and maps to defeat the grand evils. Each map has a unique objective, so planning your journey will be important!<br></li><li>Control a powerful hero to lead your forces, similar to a MOBA hero.<br></li><li>Build towers and barracks to defend your base as well as go on the offensive.<br></li><li>Manage your workers, army, and buildings in real time. Let the *really really smart AI* control your infantry or select and micro them to get the most out of them. It's up to you!<br></li><li>Gain experience and then level up! Choose powerful upgrades and relics to form your build.<br></li><li>The enemies are ceaseless and evergrowing, so the 'real time' portion of the real time strategy is greatly emphasized.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153500/extras/e0a304b06de354e55c2a2b4da9bcdd11.gif?t=1770146785\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2153500/extras/e0a304b06de354e55c2a2b4da9bcdd11.poster.avif?t=1770146785\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" sr